{"availability":"available","full":"SalesforceAIResearch/MCP-Universe","name":"MCP-Universe","description":"MCP-Universe is a comprehensive framework designed for RL training, benchmarking, and developing AI agents for general tool-use.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":603,"forks":88,"created":"2025-05-02T05:47:55Z","updated":"2026-10-08T01:29:22Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mcp-universe.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://mcp-universe.github.io/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:33.855Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:33.855Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:33.855Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:33.855Z","stars":603,"forks":88}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["📊 MCPMark Evaluation - MCP-Universe now supports evaluating the MCPMark tasks 🚀 MCP+ - Agentic wrapper on MCP clients which reduce token costs by up to 75% 🔬 Deep Research Agent - Scale the Width of Deep Research Agents with parallel tool calling, improving performance and efficiency","For programmatic web research, see the deep-research harness quickstart.","MCP-Universe is a comprehensive ecosystem for building, optimizing, and evaluating AI agents that interact with the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Beyond our industry-leading benchmark for real-world MCP server interactions, MCP-Universe provides production-ready tools for agent development including specialized research agents (Deep Research Agent), intelligent context management (MCP+), and sophisticated orchestration workflows."],"features":["🎯 Long-horizon reasoning across multi-step tasks","🔧 Large, unfamiliar tool spaces with diverse MCP servers","🌍 Real-world data sources and live environments","⚡ Dynamic evaluation with time-sensitive ground truth","💰 Massive Cost Reduction: 50-75% token savings on tool outputs"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SalesforceAIResearch/MCP-Universe/blob/main/README.md","f